  "display_title": "The Maid’s Secret Tea Recipe for the Prince",
  "description": "In the bustling royal palace, Erica, reborn into nobility with a passion for tea-brewing from her past life, finds her future steeped in drama. Her exceptional tea-making skills quickly catch the court's attention. Navigating the tricky politics of tea time, Erica must charm the demanding Crown Prince with her unique blends. Each cup she crafts could bring her closer to her dream of opening a teahouse in the capital or spell disaster. Join Erica in a delightful mix of comedy, romance, and royal intrigue, where every brew has the power to shape her destiny and uncover secrets. \n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)",
